{
  "beat_01": "Isse pehle ki aap yakeen karein ke khalifa ne Alexandria ki library jala di thi, jaan lijiye ke is kahani ka us sadi se koi saboot nahi milta. Asli kahani ek aag ki nahi hai yeh 300-saal ki dheemi maut hai, jisme kam se kam teen alag-alag mujrim hain, aur sabse mashhoor waale ne shayad kabhi ek scroll ko bhi haath nahi lagaya.",
  "beat_02": "Aaj hum yeh jaanenge ke Alexandria ki library ke saath asal mein kya hua tha — kya pakka hai, kis baat par itihaaskaar ab bhi behas karte hain, aur kaun si mashhoor kahani lagbhag pakke taur par ek myth hai.",
  "beat_03": "Yeh library Mouseion ka hissa thi, jo Misr mein shuruaati Ptolemaic vansh ke daur mein banaai gayi ek research sanstha thi. Rivayat ke mutabik, Phalerum ke Demetrius ne yeh idea Ptolemy pratham ko diya tha — lekin kuch itihaaskaar unke asal role ko shak ke ghere mein rakhte hain, toh ise mumkin maaniye, pakka nahi.",
  "beat_04": "Kisi ko theek-theek nahi pata ke usme kitne scroll the. Andaaze 40,000 se lekar 700,000 tak jaate hain — lekin yeh sabse bada aankda sadiyon baad ke puraane likhakon se aaya hai, aur aaj ke itihaaskaar ise lagbhag pakke taur par badha-chadhakar bataya gaya maante hain."
}
